      "title": "What actually makes degradation parameterization fast",
      "summary": "A class of degradation fit that took about 16 hours per forward run in the literature, and over 72 hours at 10 °C, runs in 34 seconds on the Ionworks pipeline. The biggest single win was not model order. It was fixing unbounded memory growth.",
